                                "target_lang_sense_clarification": "指人体或哺乳动物乳房上的突起。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                },
                {
                    "sense_id": "3f41f2bc-1d36-3846-9505-5cc2aabf0d93",
                    "sense_definition": "The rubber or silicone part of a baby bottle that an infant sucks on.",
